abstract: >-
  AI Project Standard is a set of blueprints — material to copy into your own
  project — for running an open source repository and for working in one with
  an AI agent. Each blueprint answers one trigger, states the decisions it
  makes and why, and records what it was run against. The repository is also
  an instance of some of its own blueprints, so drift between the payload and
  the live file is a defect rather than a detail.
